    icon: '💡',
  },
  data: {
    LLM: "Prioritize the marriage. A single Trump Marriage (40 pts) is worth more than a natural Ace and 3 combined (21 pts). If you have a King and Knight, save them until you need to snatch the lead.\n\nThe Lead Management: Don't lead your high point cards (Aces/3s) unless you are sure they won't be trumped. Use small cards (2s/4s) to 'bait' out your opponent's high cards before playing your Mariaccio.\n\nDefensive Holding: If your opponent has a high score and is close to 250, try to empty their trump reserves early. Without trumps, their marriages in other suits can still be trumped by you, nullifying their bonus point potential.",
    Player: "Prioritize the marriage. A single Trump Marriage (40 pts) is worth more than a natural Ace and 3 combined (21 pts). If you have a King and Knight, save them until you need to snatch the lead.\n\nThe Lead Management: Don't lead your high point cards (Aces/3s) unless you are sure they won't be trumped. Use small cards (2s/4s) to 'bait' out your opponent's high cards before playing your Mariaccio.\n\nDefensive Holding: If your opponent has a high score and is close to 250, try to empty their trump reserves early. Without trumps, their marriages in other suits can still be trumped by you, nullifying their bonus point potential.",
    aggressiveness: 0.5,
    riskTolerance: 0.5,
